CLASS documentation
===================

The committed PDF manual is at `doc/manual/CLASS_MANUAL.pdf`. The generated
HTML and LaTeX directories are intentionally ignored.

The Doxygen input is configured in `doc/input/doxyconf`. It extracts current
source documentation and the hand-written chapters listed in `INPUT=`. The
historical C-architecture chapter `input/chap3.md` is deliberately excluded:
it describes the former manual `*_init()` / `*_free()` lifecycle and is kept
only as an archive.

Documentation follows the policy in [README.md](../README.md#documentation):
code and tests define behaviour; Doxygen captures public contracts and
non-obvious domain context without duplicating implementation details.

To generate the HTML and LaTeX output locally, install Doxygen and run:

    cd doc/input && doxygen doxyconf

The CI workflow runs this command with warnings treated as errors.
